  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "1. Weights W and activations X sit in HBM3e.",
      "focus": ["hbm-dram-left", "hbm-dram-right", "hbm-base-left", "hbm-base-right"],
      "dot": "hbm-dram-left",
      "explode": 0.6,
      "drill": null,
      "stage": "hbm"
    },
    {
      "text": "2. A memory controller reads the HBM stack attached to its die.",
      "focus": ["mc-die0"],
      "dot": "mc-die0",
      "stage": "memory-controller"
    },
    {
      "text": "3. If the data lives in the other die's HBM, it crosses NV-HBI at 10 TB/s — invisible to software.",
      "focus": ["nv-hbi"],
      "dot": "nv-hbi",
      "stage": "die-to-die"
    },
    {
      "text": "4. Data lands in the shared L2 cache.",
      "focus": ["l2-die0"],
      "dot": "l2-die0",
      "stage": "l2"
    },
    {
      "text": "5. TMA copies A and B tiles from L2 into shared memory, asynchronously.",
      "focus": ["tma"],
      "dot": "tma",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "tma"
    },
    {
      "text": "6. Tiles sit in shared memory, ready for the Tensor Cores.",
      "focus": ["smem"],
      "dot": "smem",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "shared-memory"
    },
    {
      "text": "7. One thread issues tcgen05.mma: the 4 Tensor Cores multiply the tiles (e.g. in FP4).",
      "focus": ["tensor-core"],
      "dot": "tensor-core",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "tensor-core"
    },
    {
      "text": "8. Partial sums accumulate in TMEM, not in registers. Steps 5–8 repeat along K.",
      "focus": ["tmem"],
      "dot": "tmem",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "accumulate"
    },
    {
      "text": "9. Epilogue: results move TMEM → registers; CUDA cores add bias, apply activation, quantize.",
      "focus": ["register-file", "warp-scheduler"],
      "dot": "register-file",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "epilogue"
    },
    {
      "text": "10. Results go back to HBM via TMA; with tensor parallelism, NVLink all-reduces with other GPUs.",
      "focus": ["nvlink-die0"],
      "dot": "nvlink-die0",
      "drill": null,
      "stage": "writeback"
    }
  ],
